Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}In this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:01.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}you can only\Nsay names
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.93,0:00:03.00,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}one hundred\Ntimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.26,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Every time you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.40,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}your number\Ngoes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:06.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}And when it\Nreaches zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}everyone\Nforgets you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.60,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Eli still had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.53,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}all one hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:11.86,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Not because\Nhe was brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.00,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}not because\Nhe was smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.53,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}He was just\Ntoo shy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:15.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}to call anyone\Nby name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:16.80,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Every night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:17.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}pale figures stood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}outside his\Nwindow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.86,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}The town called\Nthem ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:21.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,281)}But one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:22.80,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,281)}one of them\Nheld up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,281)}a faded name tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}Eli leaned closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:26.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}Mara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:27.20,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}he whispered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:28.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}His number\Ndropped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:29.13,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}to ninety-nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:30.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}and the ghost\Nturned human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:32.40,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}That's when he\Nunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:33.53,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}They weren't\Ndead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:34.66,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,1000)}They were\Nforgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:36.40,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}So Eli opened\Nthe door,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:37.40,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}and started saying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.53,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}every name\Nhe could.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:39.93,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}One after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:40.86,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Fifty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:41.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:42.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.00,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:44.13,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,320)}By sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.53,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,320)}the forgotten\Nwere home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:46.73,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(270,730)}Mothers cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.20,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Friends ran\Nto each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:49.46,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}Families were\Nwhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.00,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}And Eli's number
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:51.33,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,832)}hit zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.26,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,852)}After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:53.40,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,852)}no one\Nremembered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:54.46,White,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(324,852)}the boy who\Nsaved them.
